// data/quests.ron — Vec<QuestDef>. M6 branching questline.
// requirement: None|TechCompleted(tech_id)|ShipTraveling|WarpJumped|Manual (Manual = titik
// cabang, butuh player pick via `choose_branch`, tak pernah auto-advance).
// stages[].branches: kosong=terminal, 1=auto-chain linear, >1=titik cabang NYATA (hasil beda).
// arc: "pioneer" (5 quest, awal permainan) | "warp_frontier" (5 quest, prestige/riset lanjut).
